   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Level 1: across tool calls\n\n\"Compare 5 CRM tools\" \u2192 the model emits 5 web_search calls in ONE step.\nThe loop runs them with Promise.all and waits for all of them.\nMeasured: 1.8 s for the batch vs 6.8 s if run one after another.",
   "originalText": "Level 1: across tool calls\n\n\"Compare 5 CRM tools\" \u2192 the model emits 5 web_search calls in ONE step.\nThe loop runs them with Promise.all and waits for all of them.\nMeasured: 1.8 s for the batch vs 6.8 s if run one after another.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 84,
   "containerId": "el49",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
