   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Level 2: inside one search\n\nA search with a time window sends an undated and a dated query together\n(Promise.allSettled). Date filters hide undated pages such as pricing pages,\nso the undated query keeps them. If the dated one fails, the other still answers.",
   "originalText": "Level 2: inside one search\n\nA search with a time window sends an undated and a dated query together\n(Promise.allSettled). Date filters hide undated pages such as pricing pages,\nso the undated query keeps them. If the dated one fails, the other still answers.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 84,
   "containerId": "el51",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
