   "text": "Isolation\n\nEach call has its own timeout and abort signal. A slow or failed search\nbecomes an error result for that call only; the rest of the batch is used.\nStop aborts every call of the turn at once.",
   "originalText": "Isolation\n\nEach call has its own timeout and abort signal. A slow or failed search\nbecomes an error result for that call only; the rest of the batch is used.\nStop aborts every call of the turn at once.",
